'''Red Sky at Night''' is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]] and appears every Tuesday. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]]: Catyphoon.

